  "solution": "**Formula used:**\n\nLet the original fraction be x/y.\n\nNew fraction = (1.17x) / (0.88y) = 39 / 44\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(1.17x) / (0.88y) = 39 / 44\n\n⇒ (1.17x × 44) / (0.88y × 44) = (39 × 44) / (44 × 44)\n\n⇒ (1.17 / 0.88) × (x / y) = 39 / 44\n\n⇒ x / y = (39 × 0.88) / (44 × 1.17)\n\n⇒ x / y = 0.88 / 1.17\n\n⇒ x / y = 2 / 3\n\n**∴ The original fraction is 2/3.**",
